        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:001",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "What does \"shuai guo\" (shifting the blame) mean?",
          "file": "elevenlabs/en-us/2026-10-07-what-does-shifting-the-blame-mean_dialogue_001_en-us.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-07T20:12:31+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "gOupLcAkjEnguROwi4oS",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "001",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:002",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Throwing a pot onto your head.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/en-us/2026-10-07-what-does-shifting-the-blame-mean_dialogue_002_en-us.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-07T20:12:34+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "7QN34D2r3hCNwbOYIeK0",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "002",
          "speaker": "child"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:003",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Like when Mom makes a mistake and breaks the window, then says it's my fault.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/en-us/2026-10-07-what-does-shifting-the-blame-mean_dialogue_003_en-us.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-07T20:12:36+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "gOupLcAkjEnguROwi4oS",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "003",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:004",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "You break a toy and say it's your big brother's fault. That's shifting the blame.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/en-us/2026-10-07-what-does-shifting-the-blame-mean_dialogue_004_en-us.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-07T20:12:38+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "gOupLcAkjEnguROwi4oS",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "004",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:005",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "It's your fault, but then you say it's someone else's fault.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/en-us/2026-10-07-what-does-shifting-the-blame-mean_dialogue_005_en-us.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-07T20:12:40+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "gOupLcAkjEnguROwi4oS",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "005",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:006",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "You're the one shifting the blame!",
          "file": "elevenlabs/en-us/2026-10-07-what-does-shifting-the-blame-mean_dialogue_006_en-us.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-07T20:12:42+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "7QN34D2r3hCNwbOYIeK0",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "006",
          "speaker": "child"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:007",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Mom asked me, \"Did you do something to that window?\" And the pot is black, too.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/en-us/2026-10-07-what-does-shifting-the-blame-mean_dialogue_007_en-us.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-07T20:12:47+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "gOupLcAkjEnguROwi4oS",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "007",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:008",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "She throws it onto my head, and I'm stuck carrying the black pot—taking the blame for something I didn't do.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/en-us/2026-10-07-what-does-shifting-the-blame-mean_dialogue_008_en-us.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-07T20:12:50+08:00",
