          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "ZCh4e9eZSUf41K4cmCEL",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          }
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:001",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "¿Qué significa \"shuai guo\" (echarle la culpa a otro)?",
          "file": "elevenlabs/es-es/2026-10-07-what-does-shifting-the-blame-mean_dialogue_001_es-es.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-07T20:13:02+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "LlZr3QuzbW4WrPjgATHG",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "001",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:002",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Tirarte una olla a la cabeza.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/es-es/2026-10-07-what-does-shifting-the-blame-mean_dialogue_002_es-es.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-07T20:13:05+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "Nh2zY9kknu6z4pZy6FhD",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "002",
          "speaker": "child"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:003",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Como cuando mamá comete un error y rompe la ventana, y luego dice que es culpa mía.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/es-es/2026-10-07-what-does-shifting-the-blame-mean_dialogue_003_es-es.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-07T20:13:07+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "LlZr3QuzbW4WrPjgATHG",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "003",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:004",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Tú rompes un juguete y dices que es culpa de tu hermano mayor. Eso es echarle la culpa a otro.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/es-es/2026-10-07-what-does-shifting-the-blame-mean_dialogue_004_es-es.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-07T20:13:19+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "LlZr3QuzbW4WrPjgATHG",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "004",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:005",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Es culpa tuya, pero luego dices que es culpa de otra persona.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/es-es/2026-10-07-what-does-shifting-the-blame-mean_dialogue_005_es-es.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-07T20:13:21+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "LlZr3QuzbW4WrPjgATHG",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "005",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:006",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "¡El que le echa la culpa a otro eres tú!",
          "file": "elevenlabs/es-es/2026-10-07-what-does-shifting-the-blame-mean_dialogue_006_es-es.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-07T20:13:23+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "Nh2zY9kknu6z4pZy6FhD",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "006",
          "speaker": "child"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:007",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Mamá me preguntó: «¿Le has hecho algo a esa ventana?». Y encima la olla es negra.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/es-es/2026-10-07-what-does-shifting-the-blame-mean_dialogue_007_es-es.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-07T20:13:27+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "LlZr3QuzbW4WrPjgATHG",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "007",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:008",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Me la tira a la cabeza y me hace cargar con la olla negra, o sea, con la culpa de algo que no he hecho.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/es-es/2026-10-07-what-does-shifting-the-blame-mean_dialogue_008_es-es.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-07T20:13:30+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "LlZr3QuzbW4WrPjgATHG",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
