    {
      "track_id": "fr-FR-elevenlabs",
      "code": "fr-FR",
      "language": "法语",
      "variant": "法国法语",
      "clips": [
        {
          "segment_id": "title",
          "type": "title",
          "source_text": "Ça veut dire quoi, rejeter la faute sur quelqu'un d'autre ?",
          "file": "elevenlabs/fr-fr/2026-10-07-what-does-shifting-the-blame-mean_title_fr-fr.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-07T20:13:44+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "aQROLel5sQbj1vuIVi6B",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          }
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:001",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Ça veut dire quoi, \"shuai guo\" (rejeter la faute sur quelqu'un d'autre) ?",
          "file": "elevenlabs/fr-fr/2026-10-07-what-does-shifting-the-blame-mean_dialogue_001_fr-fr.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-07T20:13:48+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "UBXZKOKbt62aLQHhc1Jm",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "001",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:002",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Te lancer une casserole sur la tête.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/fr-fr/2026-10-07-what-does-shifting-the-blame-mean_dialogue_002_fr-fr.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-07T20:13:50+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "nr2EGJNe96rzn9FRlTId",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "002",
          "speaker": "child"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:003",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Par exemple, maman fait une bêtise et casse la fenêtre, puis elle dit que c'est ma faute.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/fr-fr/2026-10-07-what-does-shifting-the-blame-mean_dialogue_003_fr-fr.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-07T20:13:53+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "UBXZKOKbt62aLQHhc1Jm",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "003",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:004",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Tu casses un jouet et tu dis que c'est la faute de ton grand frère. C'est ça, rejeter la faute sur quelqu'un d'autre.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/fr-fr/2026-10-07-what-does-shifting-the-blame-mean_dialogue_004_fr-fr.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-07T20:13:56+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "UBXZKOKbt62aLQHhc1Jm",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "004",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:005",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "C'est ta faute, mais après, tu dis que c'est la faute de quelqu'un d'autre.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/fr-fr/2026-10-07-what-does-shifting-the-blame-mean_dialogue_005_fr-fr.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-07T20:14:07+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "UBXZKOKbt62aLQHhc1Jm",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "005",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:006",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "C'est toi qui rejettes la faute sur les autres !",
          "file": "elevenlabs/fr-fr/2026-10-07-what-does-shifting-the-blame-mean_dialogue_006_fr-fr.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-07T20:14:14+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "nr2EGJNe96rzn9FRlTId",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "006",
          "speaker": "child"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:007",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Maman m'a demandé : « Tu as fait quelque chose à cette fenêtre ? » Et en plus, la casserole est noire.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/fr-fr/2026-10-07-what-does-shifting-the-blame-mean_dialogue_007_fr-fr.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-07T20:14:17+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "UBXZKOKbt62aLQHhc1Jm",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "007",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:008",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Elle me la lance sur la tête et me fait porter la casserole noire, c'est-à-dire la faute de quelque chose que je n'ai pas fait.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/fr-fr/2026-10-07-what-does-shifting-the-blame-mean_dialogue_008_fr-fr.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-07T20:14:20+08:00",
